  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "前にルームツアーしてほしいって\r\nコメント来てたから、今日は事務所探検するね～？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『今バイト休憩中！　見れて嬉しい！』\r\n『ばっちり見えてるよ！』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あとコメントも適当に読むかも～！\r\nじゃあ早速行くね～、まずは事務所の玄関～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『はじめて見た！』\r\n『２８３プロって綺麗なんだな、なんか安心したわ』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
