      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "今日は誰もいないけど～\r\nいつもは結構色んなアイドルの人がいる！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『じゃあアンティーカとかもここにいるってこと！？』\r\n『ここの部屋は前にもなんかで見たことあるな』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『雛菜ちゃんはノクチル以外で仲いい子いる？』\r\n『この子って２８３プロのアイドルだったんだー』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010150,
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『ソファに雛菜ちゃんの好きなキャラのクッションある！』",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そう～！　ユアクマちゃんのクッションいいでしょ～\r\n寝る時用に雛菜が持ってきたやつ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『そこで寝てるのかよ！』\r\n『そのキャラあんま可愛くなくない？　笑』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010170,
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『今来た！　これアーカイブ残す？』",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～、わかんない！\r\nじゃあ次キッチンに行きます～",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
