  {
    "id": 2023005010190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "──これがいつもおやつの入ってる冷蔵庫！\r\nここでたまに料理してる人とかもいるかな～",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『え、アイドルがってこと？　誰がやってるの？』\r\n『今日他のアイドル居たらよかったのになー』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『雛菜は料理できるの？』\r\n『今度料理してるところ撮ってよ！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "は～い、じゃあ今日はここまでで終わりね～？\r\n他にも見せていいとこあったらまたやる！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『他ユニのファンだけど事務所見られてよかった』\r\n『初見だった！　フォローしたからまたやって！』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『ルームツアー、雛菜ちゃんのお部屋が見たかった……』\r\n『雛菜ちゃんの部屋見たい！　今度やってくれる？』",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『いっぱい質問したのに読んでもらえなかったー泣』\r\n『バイト戻る！　バイバイ！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010210,
    "speaker": "コメント",
    "text": "『いつもどおりゆるくて面白かった！』",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010220,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～、よかったね～！\r\nじゃあ今日はこれで終わり！　ばいばい～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
