      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃあ、\r\n今度は雛菜の部屋の紹介をやるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010240,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………？\r\nなんで～？　やらないよ～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、でもコメントに来てただろ？\r\n雛菜の部屋のルームツアーが見たかったって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010250,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あ～……\r\nでも、雛菜それはやるって言ってないでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300501/2023005010250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………！\r\nあれ、わざと読まなかったのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005010260,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
